    <string name="help_title">About this installer</string>
    <string name="help_body">OpenBook runs from the USB stick until you install it. Nothing on this computer changes until you type the disk\'s name and confirm on step 5.\n\nThe hardware check shows what works on this laptop. A report and the install log are saved in the openbook/logs folder on the stick, for support.\n\nTo try OpenBook without installing, pick Try on step 3. The Install OpenBook shortcut stays in the taskbar.</string>

