    <string name="gapps_reg_no_id">No ID yet. Connect to the internet and wait a minute: Google Services Framework creates the ID the first time it goes online. Then check again here, or later in Settings › About.</string>
    <string name="gapps_reg_no_gsf">The installed package has no Google Services Framework, so there is nothing to register.</string>
